{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e8dc990da39fe43b","name":"Ambusher Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-e8dc990da39fe43b","title":"Ambusher Talent Tree","revision":15815,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:14Z","sha256":"af08ed1bc7adaeccd3163633cdf616e0fb78cafa134f1189ee2f5abbce6822cd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15815","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ambusher%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e8dc990da39fe43b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You specialize in springing ambushes on your enemies.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ambush Specialist"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"}," on the first round of combat in an encounter, you can treat the first round of combat as if it were the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"}," for the purposes of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," that trigger only during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},". Additionally, during the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," you can designate a target as your Prime Target. You gain a +2 morale bonus to attack rolls against your Prime Target until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Destructive Ambusher"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Ambush Specialist"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After you designate a Prime Target, you deal +1 die of damage on attacks against the Prime Target until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Keep It Going"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Ambush Specialist"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you reduce your Prime Target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," you can designate another target within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," as your new Prime Target. This new target remains your Prime Target until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Keep Them Reeling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Ambush Specialist"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," check, opposed by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," check of your Prime Target. If your check result equals or exceeds your Prime Target's check result, your target is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against all attacks you make before the end of your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Perceptive Ambusher"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Ambush Specialist"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +5 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks against your Prime Target until the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Spring the Trap"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you and all your allies roll higher ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," checks to start combat than do all your opponents, you automatically gain a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", even if the opponents are aware of you when combat begins.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
